.TH QUADRF-PHASEGAZE 1 "September 2026" "QuadRF" "QuadRF"
.SH NAME
quadrf-phasegaze \- swept-LO phase-gradient hemisphere
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quadrf-phasegaze
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sweeps the QuadRF local oscillator over four-lane CSI (38 Msps, FFT 8192,
20 MHz LO step), runs phase-gradient DOA on the four receive channels, and
serves a packed point stream plus a static hemisphere page.
.PP
The control panel Launch button and the desktop icon both start
.B quadrf-phasegaze.service
and open
.IR /phasegaze/ ,
which nginx proxies to port 8001. Closing the last tab stops the service,
same as Spatial RF Vision. Frequency and gain can also be set from that page.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --port " N"
Listen address
.BR http://0.0.0.0:N .
Default: 8001.
.TP
.BI --web " DIR"
Directory of static files (index.html and the Three.js client). Default:
.IR /usr/share/quadrf/phasegaze .
.TP
.B --help
Print usage and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/quadrf/phasegaze
Installed browser client.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR quadrf-rf-vision (1),
.BR quadrf-jtag (1),
.BR quadrf-app (8)
